&lt;p&gt;Detailed drawings/full particulars of the proposed development showing the matters set out below must be submitted to and approved by the local planning authority, in writing, before any work is commenced. The development shall not be carried out otherwise than in accordance with the details thus approved, which shall be implemented in full prior to the first use of the development and retained in perpetuity:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
